---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import NewsletterCTA from '@/components/NewsletterCTA.astro';
import IdentityRoles from '@/components/IdentityRoles.astro';
import OffTheClock from '@/components/OffTheClock.astro';
import SocialLinks from '@/components/SocialLinks.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Jesse Poteet: Jesus follower, systems builder, fly fisherman, and home chef in Castle Rock, Colorado."
>
  <article class="site-shell section-pad max-w-3xl">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-semibold sm:text-5xl">The short version</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink-muted)] dark:text-[var(--color-dark-muted)]">
      I live in Castle Rock, Colorado with my wife Kristie and our kids Bristol and Callan. I am a Christian. Priorities are faith, family, then entrepreneurship. I design, print, and build systems so owner-run businesses can grow without burning out the person who started them. And yes, I still make time for rivers and dinner that took longer than planned.
    </p>

    <div class="my-10">
      <IdentityRoles />
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink)] dark:text-[var(--color-dark-ink)] sm:text-lg">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl">The work</h2>
      <p>
        I have spent 25+ years in graphic design. I have been in screen printing since 2013, including time as Director of Art and Production at a commercial print shop. That shop-floor experience still shapes how I build tools and teach.
      </p>
      <p>
        On the consulting side, I work as a Lead Technical Consultant in enterprise marketing automation: Marketo, HubSpot, Klaviyo, CRM, email development, and APIs. Brands I have supported include Qualcomm, CVS/Aetna, Honeywell, and Mastercard. I do not name my employer here. If you need that detail, ask.
      </p>
      <p>
        What I love most are the side gigs. My shop work lives at Alpine Apparel Co. Systems for owner-run teams live at Operator Stack. Gathered is the weekly newsletter and community for husbands and fathers. Print education and print-shop software live under PrintPro Strategies, including Startup Screen Printing, The Print Crew, Print Growth Experience, Screen Printing Toolbox, Pricely, GroupKit, and Packed.
      </p>

      <h2 class="pt-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl">Values</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-[var(--color-ink-muted)] dark:text-[var(--color-dark-muted)]">
        <li>Businesses that create freedom for family life</li>
        <li>Profitability over revenue</li>
        <li>Repeatable systems over manual effort</li>
        <li>Transparent pricing</li>
        <li>AI that cuts repetitive work while keeping human judgment</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="pt-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl">Faith and family</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-ink-muted)] dark:text-[var(--color-dark-muted)]">
        Faith comes first. Family is close behind. Outside of work I enjoy camping, fly fishing, cooking, woodworking, modular synths (beginner on purpose), and Bible study.
      </p>

      <h2 class="pt-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl">Press</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-ink-muted)] dark:text-[var(--color-dark-muted)]">
        Featured in The Apparelist and ScreenPrinting.com.
      </p>

      <h2 class="pt-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl">Find me online</h2>
      <SocialLinks class="mt-3" />
    </section>

    <div class="mt-14">
      <NewsletterCTA
        heading="Want the personal version in your inbox?"
        body="Gathered is my weekly reflection for husbands and fathers who are building something meaningful and want to stay grounded in faith, family, and identity."
        cta="Join Gathered"
      />
    </div>
  </article>

  <OffTheClock />
</BaseLayout>
